WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:03,160
Move the bed frame to the door and block it

2
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:08,500
Is it safe for now?

3
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:11,290
Is there a radio here?

4
00:00:11,790 --> 00:00:13,070
What do you want a radio for?

5
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:14,610
Listen to government emergency notifications

6
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:16,910
See if they have any emergency response

7
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:18,710
Mobile phones can download broadcasts

8
00:00:18,970 --> 00:00:21,790
And we also have level 4 and 6 headphones that can also listen to the radio.

9
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:26,160
Class 4 and 6 headphones can only listen to special frequency bands, right?

10
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:29,740
You may not be able to receive the emergency broadcast channel either.

11
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:37,360
Everything on the phone is messed up

12
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:38,900
Seeing it only makes people scared

13
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:41,200
Radios are different. Radio stations have independent power supply systems.

14
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,740
I called the police three times

15
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,020
It will last longer than a mobile phone

16
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:45,300
No one at home picked up

17
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:50,700
Then where else can we go? It’s Hokata. No matter how bad the dream is,

18
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:51,980
They were once humans too

19
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:54,490
They can't survive in the cold weather.

20
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:59,150
That's where we can survive, but

21
00:00:59,670 --> 00:01:01,710
Don't cross half the country to get to the north
